---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { business } from "../data/site";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="24-Hour Re-Clean Guarantee | Atlanta House Cleaning Pros Now"
  description="Missed checklist item? Tell us within 24 hours and we return within 2 business days to re-clean that area free. Read full terms here today!!"
>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="container prose">
      <span class="eyebrow">Guarantee</span>
      <h1>Missed something? We come back free.</h1>
      <p class="lead">If anything on your booked checklist was missed, tell us within 24 hours — text, call, or email with a photo — and we return within 2 business days to re-clean that area free.</p>
      <p><a href={business.phoneTel} style="font-weight:800">{business.phoneDisplay}</a> · <a href={business.phoneSms}>Text us →</a> · {business.email}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section>
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What&#39;s covered</h2>
      <p>Anything on the booked checklist that was missed or not completed to standard: surfaces, bathrooms, floors, dusting, trash, beds, and booked add-ons.</p>
      <h2>What&#39;s not covered</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Tasks that were not booked (e.g. inside oven when only a recurring clean was booked).</li>
        <li>Permanent stains, damage, or wear that cleaning cannot reverse.</li>
        <li>Areas we could not access (locked rooms, blocked areas, aggressive pets).</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Breakage</h2>
      <p>Report breakage within 24 hours with a photo. Claims are covered by our insurance per the <a href="/terms">terms</a>, documented and resolved in writing.</p>
      <h2>How to make a claim</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Text, call, or email within 24 hours of the visit with a photo of the area.</li>
        <li>We schedule the re-clean within 2 business days at a time that works for you.</li>
        <li>The same team returns when possible. No charge for the re-cleaned area.</li>
      </ol>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/book">Book a Clean →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
